{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>歌手邱鋒澤日前（10月31日）38歲正日生日，於澳門舉辦《Bend The Lines Concert》演唱會，他開場就對台下表示：「生日當天可以做自己喜歡的事是一件非常幸福的事情，謝謝澳門的鋒蜜（粉絲暱稱）！」當他演出到一半時，突收粉絲送上的生日蛋糕與花束，全場更齊唱生日快樂歌，令他驚喜萬分。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-02T00:47:44.028820+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":156,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-01T18:01:53+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-02T23:58:09.173890+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-02T00:41:47.220626+00:00","content_hash":"59f7462d6559ea42e6d975f4c1d9bebb86fd7e9c8eee3bc3a961ec3f6d2fbbca","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-02T00:47:44.028820+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}